--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EmbeddingGemma 2 (Google)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Search by meaning embeds each question with Google's EmbeddingGemma 2, which
the image holds and the server runs on its own processor; nothing searched
leaves the server. The model file is distributed unmodified: the ggml-org Q8_0
GGUF build of google/embeddinggemma-2 (embeddinggemma-2-Q8_0.gguf, 309,855,456
bytes, SHA-256
2188ac1deca4b77dffefd603c2776a9d76d9d74ec01841392982ebb840b09135), the file
the FRUS Explorer app publishes and names, at
/usr/share/frus-light/model/embeddinggemma-2-Q8_0.gguf. The model weights are
never committed to this repository: the image's build fetches them.

EmbeddingGemma 2 is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0); see
https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2. Neither the model's repository
nor the GGUF's carries a NOTICE file.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llama.cpp
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The image holds llama.cpp's llama-server (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp),
built from source at the commit the FRUS Explorer app pins, which runs the
model. Its licence follows. llama-server also holds libraries llama.cpp
carries: cpp-httplib and nlohmann/json (MIT), xxHash (BSD 2-Clause),
rotate-bits (MIT), and stb_image, miniaudio, a SHA-1 and a SHA-256 in the
public domain. Their licences are in /usr/share/doc/frus-light/llama.cpp, as
llama.cpp's source holds them.

